1.Debt service coberage ratio: 684% &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
Reason: The very high Debt Service Ratio of 684% is mainly because the company is earning strong profits from its operations, along with high depreciation (a non-cash expense) that increases available cash for repayments. The company also has low interest, lease, and loan repayment amounts due to careful debt management. In addition, it follows a conservative borrowing policy, which keeps pressure on cash flows low, and maintains good liquidity, giving it a strong safety cushion to pay debts on time and remain financially stable. &lt;BR&gt; 
